---
description: Keep frontend controllers focused on route actions
globs: app/Http/Index/Controller/*.php
alwaysApply: false
---

# Frontend Controller Actions

- In `app/Http/Index/Controller/*.php`, only route actions should be defined as controller methods.
- Do not add private helper methods just to assemble page data inside these controllers.
- Keep one-off view data preparation inline in the route action, or move reusable business/query logic into the appropriate service class.
